{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27267","headline":"赠杭州严史君 · 章孝标","name":"赠杭州严史君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"州青县白淛河濆，饱向苍龙阙下闻。\n鼓角自严寒海月，旌旗不动湿江云。\n风骚处处文章主，井邑家家父母君。\n长恐抱辕留不住，九天鸳鹭待成羣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"章孝标","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27267.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27267","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}